      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "b09e6109-ea08-4564-a73a-54446041c059",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "c1813d78-c0d1-45b9-ab11-5deb5a706889",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "09d4b889-de03-4547-ae5e-5b5ddb2321d2",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "The packet stays\ndry in a tin\nsleeve. Page ONE\ndefines the\nservice hall. Page",
                      "TWO grants pipe\naccess. Page THREE\nforbids closing\npublic branches\nfor private",
                      "priority. Its seal\nmatches the\narchive square,\nnot Slush's silver\nstationery."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "ce7b8b0b-85d4-4e0d-aee4-f58d11c0c91c",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6dee0b0c-faa6-4775-a61b-4a59142fc4d4",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "26e116a0-7468-4253-a85c-4330b19e5c27",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "dacda9d5-2142-44ab-a258-14175e88cd80",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "7ea75dc7-e0b4-4443-adfe-45a178fe4e1a",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "An estate summary\nsays the lodge may\nreserve all heat\nafter paying an\ninspection",
                      "invoice. Page TWO\ngrants service\naccess, not\nownership. Page\nTHREE forbids",
                      "closing public\nbranches for\nprivate priority.\nThe summary is\nunsigned; both",
                      "numbered pages\ncarry the city\nseal. Nib\nrecognizes his old\nphrasing in the",
                      "summary and admits\nhe repeated a\nclaim he had not\nchecked. He asks\nto correct it",
                      "where everyone can\nsee."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "e9f13675-c5b4-46bd-a706-b8bb62c75120",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3f1b707a-55bf-4029-a883-0e3c8c21867a",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "b4a6bd5b-c448-4c93-ae84-c3312caea234",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "6bd8d7a8-ba50-475c-aca7-30c04b2aa95f",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "7fd7ffc8-3a77-44b1-a472-ff7c79e289c1",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Nib: The signature\npage refers to TWO\nfor the access\nright. THREE\nlimits how that",
                      "right may be used.\nThe clerk needs\nthe access page\nfirst, then its\nlimit. I could",
                      "turn this into a\nspeech. I am\nchoosing to turn\nit into a packet."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "b7d165d7-449c-4db6-a591-ccfd81704c54",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "badf440f-f0af-4c3e-a9a9-53acb2cb1b67",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "c43da4a9-8359-4561-a6a2-4d4f987372bb",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "6c84398c-7162-4146-ac86-1dafc336ed63",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "9f9acea1-8142-497b-afd5-375e2a7c222b",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Which numbered\npage establishes\nthe right to enter\nfor pipe repairs?"
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "549ccd9e-25b8-4568-a9e3-74133d740009",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b9ccdc9c-9f87-425f-a827-c16d584c8cf3",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "21a7693d-5e58-424c-a9c1-f732e2f52970",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "ac4d8861-a233-461a-a622-33cbb46d8bee",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "3e4cdf8b-8b8b-4541-a47f-f0e79ca4bafa",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Which claim should\nreplace the\nunsigned priority\nsentence? The\nsigned pages still",
                      "give useful repair\naccess, so the\ncorrection must\nnot erase that\nright. Compare",
                      "what each document\npermits, and let\nthe sealed terms\ngovern the\nsummary. Nib will",
                      "put his name\nbeneath the\ncorrection,\nincluding the\nuncomfortable",
                      "sentence that the\nearlier claim was\nhis mistake."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "e6c63b47-f464-49c7-a771-f85a117f5983",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "33915ed8-ae26-4826-a93b-09ff622db9a0",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 5
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "5fdd29ad-ac56-4be8-ad04-6faed0f64782",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "2ec0933e-0e87-4559-a9fd-64ff7a67a289",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "affb7f2c-3cc4-462b-a382-3cbba335999c",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "The clerk posts\nthe packet beside\nthe wheel. Private\nrooms remain\nprivate; public",
                      "service stays\npublic. Slush asks\nfor clear fault\nreports in return.\nPip accepts the",
                      "duty and names\nMoxie as the\nperson who will\ncarry reports if a\nwire fails."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "b0363acb-7c22-4c5f-a92b-285346b98020",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    }
